cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below and cite the SICAPv2 dataset."
title: "Gleason Pattern Segmentation of Prostate Biopsy Whole-Slide Images: reproducible code"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline for pixel-level Gleason pattern segmentation (GG3/GG4/GG5,
  benign) on SICAPv2 prostate biopsy cores, with core-level Gleason / ISUP grade
  derivation under an explicit, shared rule set, and three-level evaluation
  (pixel-level Dice/IoU, core-level grade agreement, ROC).
type: software
authors:
